<title>BELGIUM: Belgian yr/yr inflation 1.58 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Belgian yr/yr inflation 1.58 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Economics Ministry released the following data on inflation -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN CONSUMER PRICES     May	  April     May 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)	 124.09     123.91     122.16</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	 0.15	-0.02	-0.17</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	   1.58	 1.26	 1.90</p>
<p>The ministry said price rises were mainly seen for fresh vegetables, meat, tobacco, cut flowers and holiday homes.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
